<h1 id="supasidebar-0.19.8">SupaSidebar 0.19.8</h1>
<h2 id="whats-new">What’s New</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Switch Spaces with Mouse Wheel</strong>: A new opt-in toggle lets you scroll your mouse wheel to switch between spaces.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="bug-fixes">Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Saved links to Google apps like Docs and Gmail now show their correct icons, and more sites now load one at all.</li>
<li>Opening the Move to Folder menu no longer freezes the app.</li>
</ul>
